OL,3,GNEWSACharity campaign aims to improve
OL,4,Amental health support
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campaign has been launched by mental
OL,7,Fhealth charities and a search and
OL,8,Frescue organisation, aimed at
OL,9,Fencouraging people to have
OL,10,Fconversations before getting to a point
OL,11,Fof crisis.
OL,13,FThe 'We See You' campaign is a
OL,14,Fcollaboration between Channel Islands
OL,15,FAir Search (CIAS), Guernsey Mind and
OL,16,FMind Jersey.
OL,18,FCIAS's involvement stems from it
OL,19,Frevealing 42% of call outs are to help
OL,20,Ffind, and rescue missing persons, many
OL,21,Fof whom will be facing mental health
OL,22,Fchallenges.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
